 of platforms), reachable only by a precise optional jump and holding a cluster of rewards. Coins are arranged in arcs and short rows that trace the intended leap trajectories, curving between platforms and over the deepest gaps to guide movement rightward and hint at the bonus route. This is among the harder stretches of the level, so platform spacing and hazard density increase from the calmer left entry toward the right, where the platform path delivers the hero to the right boundary and the layout flows continuously into the castle stronghold segment. The vertical space well below the platform chain stays clear as the open drop, and the upper portion of the box stays mostly open sky apart from the highest platforms and the bonus alcove.
